---
title: Login and Session Flow
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser
    participant Gateway as API Gateway
    participant Auth as Auth Service
    participant Tokens as Token Store
    participant Sessions as Session Cache

    Browser->>Gateway: POST /login with credentials
    Gateway->>Auth: forward login request
    Auth->>Tokens: validate bearer token signature
    Tokens-->>Auth: token record with scopes
    Auth->>Sessions: look up existing session
    alt session cache miss
        Sessions-->>Auth: miss
        Auth->>Sessions: create session from token scopes
    else session cache hit
        Sessions-->>Auth: cached session
    end
    Auth-->>Gateway: session cookie and expiry
    Gateway-->>Browser: 200 with Set-Cookie
